Third-party software
--------------------
This package contains no third-party source code. It depends on third-party
packages (mcp, chromadb, pydantic, python-dotenv, watchdog, pypdfium2,
python-docx, and optional extras) that pip, pipx or uv installs separately from
their own upstream releases. Each keeps its own licence and notices, which ship
with that package. THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md lists every direct dependency, its
declared licence and where it comes from.

With LOCUS_EMBEDDER=local, the engine downloads the intfloat/multilingual-e5-small
embedding model (MIT licence) from Hugging Face on first use. The model is not
included in this package.
